bel": "直线不能解释的 Y 的变异百分比", "key": 0.02788507581080668, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.00051, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": [[0.9721149241891933, "这是能解释的百分比（R²）。不能解释的是 1 − R²。"]]}]}, {"id": "6_Reg_resumen_N1", "title": "用汇总数据做回归 · 第 1 级 · 有引导", "color": "t3", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "X = 培训花费（千欧元），Y = 生产率（件）。汇总数据：", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "tabla", "headers": ["数据", "值"], "rows": [["x̄", 40], ["ȳ", 620], ["Sx² (varianza de X)", 144], ["Sy² (varianza de Y)", 22500], ["Sxy (covarianza)", 1440]]}, {"t": "hint", "text": "b = Sxy / Sx² · a = ȳ − b·x̄ · r = Sxy / (Sx·Sy) · R² = r²"}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "斜率 b", "key": 10.0, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.01, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[120.0, "b = Sxy / Sx²：除以 X 的方差（Sx 的平方）。"], [0.064, "这是 X 对 Y 的斜率（你除以了 Sy²）。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "截距 a（término independiente）", "key": 220.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.22, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "相关系数 r", "key": 0.8, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.0008, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "R²（小数）", "key": 0.6400000000000001, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.0006400000000000002, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "55000 欧元时 Y 的预测值", "key": 770.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.77, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[550220.0, "注意单位：如果 X 以千为单位，55000 欧元就是 X = 55。"]]}]}, {"id": "6_Reg_resumen_N2", "title": "用汇总数据做回归 · 第 2 级 · 有表头", "color": "t3", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "X = 工龄（年），Y = 每年病假天数 ×10。汇总数据：", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "tabla", "headers": ["数据", "值"], "rows": [["x̄", 8], ["ȳ", 1800], ["Sx (desviación típica de X)", 3], ["Sy (desviación típica de Y)", 300], ["Sxy (covarianza)", -540]]}, {"t": "hint", "text": "注意：这里给的是标准差（S），不是方差（S²）。"}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "斜率 b", "key": -60.0, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.06, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[-180.0, "b = Sxy / Sx²：除以 X 的方差（Sx 的平方）。"], [-0.006, "这是 X 对 Y 的斜率（你除以了 Sy²）。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "截距 a（término independiente）", "key": 2280.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 2.2800000000000002, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "相关系数 r", "key": -0.6, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.0006, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "R²（小数）", "key": 0.36, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.00051, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "10 年时 Y 的预测值", "key": 1680.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 1.68, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}]}, {"id": "6_Reg_resumen_N3", "title": "用汇总数据做回归 · 第 3 级 · 没有帮助", "color": "t3", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "X = 评估价（千欧元），Y = 售价（千欧元）。汇总数据：", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "tabla", "headers": ["数据", "值"], "rows": [["x̄", 150], ["ȳ", 210], ["Sx (desviación típica de X)", 30], ["Sy (desviación típica de Y)", 40], ["r (correlación)", 0.85]]}, {"t": "hint", "text": "先求协方差：Sxy = r·Sx·Sy。"}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "协方差 Sxy", "key": 1020.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 1.02, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "斜率 b", "key": 1.1333333333333333, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.0011333333333333334, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[34.0, "b = Sxy / Sx²：除以 X 的方差（Sx 的平方）。"], [0.6375, "这是 X 对 Y 的斜率（你除以了 Sy²）。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "截距 a（término independiente）", "key": 40.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.04, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "R²（小数）", "key": 0.7224999999999999, "dec": 3, "tol": 0.0007224999999999999, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "180000 欧元时 Y 的预测值", "key": 244.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.244, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[204040.0, "注意单位：如果 X 以千为单位，55000 欧元就是 X = 55。"]]}]}, {"id": "7_Indices_N1", "title": "指数和变化率 · 第 1 级 · 有引导", "color": "t4", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "一家公司的年销售额（千欧元）。", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "hint", "text": "以 2020 为基期的指数 = 值/2020 年的值 × 100。变化率 = 值/前一年 − 1。年平均变化率 = (1 + 总变化率)^(1/年数) − 1。"}, {"t": "trabajo", "headers": ["年", "销售额", "指数（基期 2020）", "比上一年的变化率", "指数（基期 2022）"], "given": [[2020, 1250], [2021, 1300], [2022, 1365], [2023, 1350], [2024, 1420]], "keys": [[100.0, 0.0, 91.57509157509158], [104.0, 0.040000000000000036, 95.23809523809523], [109.2, 0.050000000000000044, 100.0], [108.0, -0.01098901098901095, 98.9010989010989], [113.6, 0.051851851851851816, 104.02930402930404]], "hints": ["=B/B$2020*100", "=B/前一个B−1", "=指数/2022年指数*100"], "dec": [2, 4, 2]}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2020-2024 总变化率（小数）", "key": 0.1359999999999999, "dec": 4, "tol": 0.0001359999999999999, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2020-2024 年平均变化率（小数）", "key": 0.032391886619581145, "dec": 4, "tol": 5.1000000000000006e-05, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": [[0.032715710215710236, "你算的是变化率的算术平均。要用几何平均：(1+T)^(1/4) − 1。"], [0.033999999999999975, "不是把变化率除以 4：(1+T)^(1/4) − 1。"], [0.025830639140963285, "从 2020 到 2024 是 4 年，不是 5 年。"]]}]}, {"id": "7_Indices_N2", "title": "指数和变化率 · 第 2 级 · 有表头", "color": "t4", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "一个工会会员人数的年变化率：2021 +4%，2022 +6%，2023 −3%，2024 +5%，2025 +2%。基期 2020 = 100。", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "trabajo", "headers": ["年", "变化率", "指数（2020 = 100）"], "given": [[2020, null], [2021, 0.04], [2022, 0.06], [2023, -0.03], [2024, 0.05], [2025, 0.02]], "keys": [[100.0], [104.0], [110.24000000000001], [106.9328], [112.27944000000001], [114.52502880000002]], "hints": null, "dec": [2]}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2020-2025 累计变化率（小数）", "key": 0.14525028800000017, "dec": 4, "tol": 0.00014525028800000018, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": [[0.14, "百分比不能相加，要相乘（1,04 × 1,06 × …）。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "年平均变化率（小数）", "key": 0.027495862947450878, "dec": 4, "tol": 5.1000000000000006e-05, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": [[0.028000000000000004, "用几何平均，不用算术平均。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "以 2025 为基期的 2020 年指数（倒数性质）", "key": 87.31715769714783, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.08731715769714783, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}]}, {"id": "7_Indices_N3", "title": "指数和变化率 · 第 3 级 · 没有帮助", "color": "t4", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "2023 年员工人数比 2022 年增加 25%。2024 年比 2023 年减少 10%。2024 年的人数比 2025 年多 8%。", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "p", "text": "以 2022 = 100 为基期计算指数。", "b": false, "i": true}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2023 年指数", "key": 125.0, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.125, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2024 年指数", "key": 112.5, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.1125, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[115.0, "百分比不能相减：125 × 0,90。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2025 年指数", "key": 104.16666666666666, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.10416666666666666, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[103.5, "“2024 比 2025 多 8%” → 2024 = 1,08 × 2025。要除以 1,08。"]]}, {"t": "p", "text": "一个账户每年给 4,5% 的利息。", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "ask", "label": "等价的月变化率（小数）", "key": 0.0036748094004368514, "dec": 5, "tol": 5.1e-06, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": [[0.00375, "不是除以 12：(1,045)^(1/12) − 1。"]]}]}, {"id": "8_Laspeyres_IPC_N1", "title": "拉氏、帕氏指数和平减 · 第 1 级 · 有引导", "color": "t4", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "一篮子商品：基期（2020）和 2025 年的价格和数量。", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "hint", "text": "Laspeyres = Σ pₜ·q₀ / Σ p₀·q₀ × 100。Paasche = Σ pₜ·qₜ / Σ p₀·qₜ × 100。分子分母的数量是同一个。"}, {"t": "trabajo", "headers": ["商品", "p₀", "q₀", "pₜ", "qₜ", "pₜ·q₀", "p₀·q₀", "pₜ·qₜ", "p₀·qₜ"], "given": [["Pan", 1.1, 320.0, 1.3, 300.0], ["Leche", 0.95, 210.0, 1.05, 220.0], ["Fruta", 2.2, 150.0, 2.5, 140.0], ["Aceite", 6.5, 30.0, 9.0, 25.0]], "keys": [[416.0, 352.0, 390.0, 330.0], [220.5, 199.5, 231.0, 209.0], [375.0, 330.0, 350.0, 308.0], [270.0, 195.0, 225.0, 162.5]], "hints": ["=pₜ*q₀", "=p₀*q₀", "=pₜ*qₜ", "=p₀*qₜ"], "dec": [2, 2, 2, 2]}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "拉氏价格指数（Laspeyres）", "key": 119.04319554110543, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.11904319554110543, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[118.47449232293215, "这是帕氏指数。拉氏用基期的数量（q₀）。"], [84.00312134217714, "反了：分子是 2025 年的价格。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "帕氏价格指数（Paasche）", "key": 118.47449232293215, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.11847449232293215, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[119.04319554110543, "这是拉氏指数。帕氏用当期的数量（qₜ）。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "费雪指数（Fisher）", "key": 118.7585035112518, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.1187585035112518, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "p", "text": "月工资（欧元）和 IPC（消费者价格指数，2022 = 100）：", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "tabla", "headers": ["年", "工资", "IPC"], "rows": [[2022, 1500, 100], [2023, 1560, 103.2], [2024, 1610, 106.9], [2025, 1650, 110.1]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2025 年的实际工资（按 2022 年的欧元）", "key": 1498.6376021798367, "dec": 2, "tol": 1.4986376021798367, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[1816.65, "平减（deflactar）要除以 IPC（× 100）。"]]}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2022-2025 名义变化（小数）", "key": 0.10000000000000009, "dec": 4, "tol": 0.00010000000000000009, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": []}, {"t": "ask", "label": "2022-2025 实际变化（小数）", "key": -0.0009082652134422275, "dec": 4, "tol": 5.1000000000000006e-05, "kind": "pct", "accept": null, "alts": [[-0.0009999999999998899, "百分比不能相减：把实际工资和 2022 年的比较。"]]}]}, {"id": "8_Laspeyres_IPC_N2", "title": "拉氏、帕氏指数和平减 · 第 2 级 · 有表头", "color": "t4", "subtitle": null, "blocks": [{"t": "p", "text": "一篮子商品：基期（2020）和 2025 年的价格和数量。", "b": true, "i": false}, {"t": "trabajo", "headers": ["商品", "p₀", "q₀", "pₜ", "qₜ", "pₜ·q₀", "p₀·q₀", "pₜ·qₜ", "p₀·qₜ"], "given": [["Luz", 0.15, 3500.0, 0.21, 3200.0], ["Gas", 0.06, 6000.0, 0.09, 5200.0], ["Transporte", 1.5, 400.0, 1.6, 430.0]], "keys": [[735.0, 525.0, 672.0, 480.0], [540.0, 360.0, 468.0, 312.0], [640.0, 600.0, 688.0, 645.0]], "hints": null, "dec": [2, 2, 2, 2]}, {"t": "h", "text": "问题"}, {"t": "ask", "label": "拉氏价格指数（Laspeyres）", "key": 128.95622895622895, "dec": 2, "tol": 0.12895622895622896, "kind": "num", "accept": null, "alts": [[127.20946416144744, "这是帕氏指数。拉氏用基期的数量（q₀）。"], [77.5